 "782428473283391", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ABd04qXx5YQ7kNvwGtisNe&_nc_oc=AdqfDfpagxrIdMRGYiXOjN9_ETdXWCtkld9EHUOJclIOtKREeedDDYdapIcfKbtusa4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af836msMsSn7kL_hl5Y3p-vU4NXtKI0V3nmRajRJm0wN2g&oe=6A467391"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppdqELfZJegQ7kNvwG-r15s&_nc_oc=Adpow66a8F2bqU1iO85XHPChox0IhBI3HrGYl7UA9kB1RrT60Ut3QyA_mWaConA_Zu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9gvPLXlY5-XdWA4uJ5x4Pq5QZLwAF5yM_IJR5XiRPvAw&oe=6A467B5D"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B2DgSQUwyn4Q7kNvwGG-UV3&_nc_oc=Ado2z2X42ZUKTNYpf5SYOLm0EbAdGfs-QpXXAw2wVg6jwv-Qcl0rdoKdNYNZCxDAqJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bIXSLibTlvzdDeg2iisR7yIVvjSzWsL2X2XBJR3MMwg&oe=6A466E39"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Batwi8a99tIQ7kNvwE87q6G&_nc_oc=AdpUCDISpJrjjWGBApY6DFSxK10HfObEQm51I50WsLseqMIHPq1J9yF-ZbUx7KRXmCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8hG3LJijeZy4yEdAbkUviXuhbCM1tMkhOxu-7tI7la8Q&oe=6A465C8A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hye3A7fIs_gQ7kNvwG5txus&_nc_oc=Adr8GbtP-15gX9jufXuW_rPhAEjU9AaNBnzHuZ-ipXyQwnhVc_e62XeVyIAQ1kb__HI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84CpvPAmh53AyfigwIWwzjJwmOYA3c6Mk6PO2FO9CPxg&oe=6A465D5C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_to